    "change": "Normalize the assembled provider path by whole-dot segments, preserving empty segments, percent-escape spelling and UTF-8/six-ASCII encoding. Recognize the three single-dot and nine double-dot spellings with ASCII-case-insensitive percent markers. Root sentinel prevents traversal above the authority root; return address remains separate and unchanged. No signature, import or public option changes.",
